e8%87%b4%e5%8b%9d%e6%b3%95%e5%89%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>重溫「股壇長毛」David Webb的8大長線致勝法則</strong></a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">睇完新聞，記得追蹤hkmoneyclub以下平台，接收更多分析評論！</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">YouTube：<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"hkmoneyclub\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:hkmoneyclub;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@hkmoneyclub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">hkmoneyclub</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">本文所提供的信息僅供一般參考之用，並不構成任何個人化的投資勸誘或建議。作者沒持有以上提及的股票。HK MoneyClub (www.hkmoneyclub.com)</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%8C%87%E6%95%B8%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E6%89%93%E5%BA%95%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%8C-%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%8510%E6%9C%88%E6%9C%83%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%993%E9%9A%BB-%E4%BA%9E%E9%A6%AC%E9%81%9C-meta-alphabet-133500387.html",
